+++ b/releasenotes/notes/attempt-manager-async-with-a8f720c99adf1fd1.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    The attempt object yielded by ``async for attempt in AsyncRetrying(...)``
+    now supports the asynchronous context manager protocol, so ``async with
+    attempt:`` works inside the loop. It behaves exactly like ``with attempt:``.
